    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Marc Farley",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109015876752452329002/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLEfWYjKwMI5NFZNvcPgPRX5n9pWjzdjVzp7qpE6TfG6n2VhQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Always professional! Great place! Great people! Would recommend",
        "time": 1761582636,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Abhishek Khurana",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117121207865726634375/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVEUZH-ZZ6GIgjAVoVHiTe-VKj6d_e_-UKlVEto42vPEgWTrshe=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Do you want to get scammed? Go to this place.\nThey add the price of product (if you buy any) along with the cut and then expect us to pay tips on the same.\nWhy should I leave a tip on the store products?\nServices are also not great and wait times are extremely ridiculous.\nDont think I would ever visit again.",
        "time": 1747106553,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michelle Rodrigues",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108301410399198132195/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW4GK9JKXE1ADXUS2m66rszCM564BehXyVh4lBgvO4GGa8c5-9oiA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Isabelle was very nice and gave excellent haircuts to my boys. There was another woman there that washed their hair but I didn't get her name, she was very kind and friendly.\nPlace was clean and hair was swept up right away.",
        "time": 1733265015,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Adam Recine",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108856359977774704110/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLdIm6dvYMXPwfjNBJXD7TicF_TBsYNycf-xvmvelJlZEcEqw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "I'm not usually fussy about going to the same barber every time I get my haircut, but when it's a special occasion and I need someone I can trust to give a top quality and expert cut, Jeffery is my guy. What a pro! He's also a hoot to chat with.",
        "time": 1748498416,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kai Whittaker",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115813249642002099184/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX1g0ECHz9PEukZv1tx3B01_LNUczSxQ5RcZGogvdQ5uqNUG25o=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "This a three star barbershop but they lose a star for their terrible appointment system.\n\nThe cuts are decent but, for most of the barbers, not at the same the level as some of the better barbershops I’ve been to. The quality varies a lot depending on who is cutting your hair.\n\nWhen you find a barber who cuts your hair the way you like at this place, they only offer appointments for that barber one or two days per week. If you’re not available on the day the barber you like is taking appointments, get ready to wait up to an hour to get your hair cut.\n\nHere’s an example: when I checked last week, my preferred barber only had availability in three weeks, so I tried walking in. First time I walked in it was over an hour to see the barber. I tried again a few days later and there was a 40 minute wait. I tried a third time yesterday and it was at least a 30 minute wait.\n\nAt that point I kinda gave up and found an excellent barber in St Laz who takes appointments every day they’re open. They take walk-ins in between appointments. That’s a good system!\n\nI won’t be going back to Uppercuts.",
        "time": 1729275813,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
